{"seq":3,"slug":"json-support","title":"JSON 支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/json-support","wordCount":585,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"json-支持\">JSON 支持</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQLite 从 3.9.0 起内置 <strong>JSON</strong> 函数，让你能直接在 SQL 层存储、查询和操作半结构化的 JSON 数据，而无需在应用层反复解析。JSON 以 <strong>TEXT</strong> 类型存储（3.45.0 起另提供二进制格式 JSONB，存为 BLOB 且解析更快），函数则按能力分为标量、聚合和表值三类。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"json-函数概述\">JSON 函数概述</h2><p>SQLite 从 3.9.0 版本开始内置 <strong>JSON</strong> 函数支持，3.38.0 起默认编译启用（之前需要 <code>-DSQLITE_ENABLE_JSON1</code>）。这些函数让你可以直接在 SQL 中存储、查询和操作 JSON 数据，无需在应用层进行解析。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph JSON 函数分类&#10;        SCALAR[标量函数&lt;br/&gt;json_extract / json_type]&#10;        AGG[聚合函数&lt;br/&gt;json_group_array / json_group_object]&#10;        TABLE[表值函数&lt;br/&gt;json_each / json_tree]&#10;    end&#10;    JSON_DATA[(JSON 数据)] --&gt; SCALAR&#10;    JSON_DATA --&gt; AGG&#10;    JSON_DATA --&gt; TABLE\">graph LR\n    subgraph JSON 函数分类\n        SCALAR[标量函数&lt;br/&gt;json_extract / json_type]\n        AGG[聚合函数&lt;br/&gt;json_group_array / json_group_object]\n        TABLE[表值函数&lt;br/&gt;json_each / json_tree]\n    end\n    JSON_DATA[(JSON 数据)] --&gt; SCALAR\n    JSON_DATA --&gt; AGG\n    JSON_DATA --&gt; TABLE</pre><p>SQLite 中 JSON 以 <strong>TEXT</strong> 类型存储。从 3.45.0 起新增了 <strong>JSONB</strong> 二进制格式，存储为 BLOB，解析和序列化更高效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>存储类型</th>\n<th>可读性</th>\n<th>解析性能</th>\n<th>版本要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON</td>\n<td>TEXT</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>3.9+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSONB</td>\n<td>BLOB</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>3.45+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"提取与查询\">提取与查询</h2><p><strong>json_extract()</strong> 使用 JSON Path 语法从 JSON 数据中提取值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE products (&#10;    id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    name TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;    meta TEXT NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO products VALUES&#10;(1, &#39;笔记本电脑&#39;, &#39;{&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;,&quot;specs&quot;:{&quot;ram&quot;:16,&quot;storage&quot;:512},&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;pro&quot;,&quot;laptop&quot;]}&#39;),&#10;(2, &#39;智能手机&#39;, &#39;{&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;Samsung&quot;,&quot;specs&quot;:{&quot;ram&quot;:8,&quot;storage&quot;:256},&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;phone&quot;,&quot;5g&quot;]}&#39;),&#10;(3, &#39;平板电脑&#39;, &#39;{&quot;brand&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;,&quot;specs&quot;:{&quot;ram&quot;:8,&quot;storage&quot;:128},&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;education&quot;]}&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 提取顶层字段&#10;SELECT name, json_extract(meta, &#39;$.brand&#39;) AS brand FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 提取嵌套字段&#10;SELECT name, json_extract(meta, &#39;$.specs.ram&#39;) AS ram_gb FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 提取数组元素&#10;SELECT name, json_extract(meta, &#39;$.tags[0]&#39;) AS first_tag FROM products;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> products</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'笔记本电脑'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"brand\":\"Apple\",\"specs\":{\"ram\":16,\"storage\":512},\"tags\":[\"pro\",\"laptop\"]}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'智能手机'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"brand\":\"Samsung\",\"specs\":{\"ram\":8,\"storage\":256},\"tags\":[\"phone\",\"5g\"]}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'平板电脑'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"brand\":\"Apple\",\"specs\":{\"ram\":8,\"storage\":128},\"tags\":[\"tablet\",\"education\"]}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 提取顶层字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 提取嵌套字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.specs.ram'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ram_gb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 提取数组元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.tags[0]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_tag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>-&gt;</code></strong> 和 <strong><code>-&gt;&gt;</code></strong> 操作符（3.38+）提供了更简洁的语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- -&gt; 返回 JSON 值（保留引号）&#10;SELECT name, meta -&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; AS brand_json FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- -&gt;&gt; 返回 SQL 值（去除引号）&#10;SELECT name, meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; AS brand_text FROM products;&#10;&#10;-- 在 WHERE 中使用&#10;SELECT name FROM products WHERE meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; = &#39;Apple&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 嵌套路径&#10;SELECT name FROM products WHERE meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.specs.ram&#39; &gt;= 16;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- -> 返回 JSON 值（保留引号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand_json </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ->> 返回 SQL 值（去除引号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand_text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在 WHERE 中使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Apple'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 嵌套路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.specs.ram'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>-&gt;&gt;</code> 操作符返回的是 SQL 原生类型（TEXT/INTEGER/REAL），而 <code>-&gt;</code> 返回的是 JSON 文本。在 WHERE 条件和索引中，通常使用 <code>-&gt;&gt;</code> 更合适。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"修改-json\">修改 JSON</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- json_set：设置值（存在则更新，不存在则插入）&#10;SELECT json_set(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2}&#39;, &#39;$.c&#39;, 3);&#10;-- {&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2,&quot;c&quot;:3}&#10;&#10;-- json_replace：仅更新已存在的键&#10;SELECT json_replace(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2}&#39;, &#39;$.a&#39;, 10, &#39;$.c&#39;, 3);&#10;-- {&quot;a&quot;:10,&quot;b&quot;:2}（$.c 不存在，被忽略）&#10;&#10;-- json_insert：仅插入不存在的键&#10;SELECT json_insert(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2}&#39;, &#39;$.a&#39;, 10, &#39;$.c&#39;, 3);&#10;-- {&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2,&quot;c&quot;:3}（$.a 已存在，被忽略）&#10;&#10;-- json_remove：删除键&#10;SELECT json_remove(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2,&quot;c&quot;:3}&#39;, &#39;$.b&#39;);&#10;-- {&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;c&quot;:3}&#10;&#10;-- json_patch：合并两个 JSON 对象（RFC 7396）&#10;SELECT json_patch(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;b&quot;:2}&#39;, &#39;{&quot;b&quot;:null,&quot;c&quot;:3}&#39;);&#10;-- {&quot;a&quot;:1,&quot;c&quot;:3}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_set：设置值（存在则更新，不存在则插入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_set(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"a\":1,\"b\":2,\"c\":3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_replace：仅更新已存在的键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_replace(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"a\":10,\"b\":2}（$.c 不存在，被忽略）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_insert：仅插入不存在的键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_insert(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.a'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.c'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"a\":1,\"b\":2,\"c\":3}（$.a 已存在，被忽略）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_remove：删除键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_remove(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2,\"c\":3}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.b'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"a\":1,\"c\":3}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_patch：合并两个 JSON 对象（RFC 7396）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_patch(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":1,\"b\":2}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"b\":null,\"c\":3}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">