trong>json_each()</strong> 和 <strong>json_tree()</strong> 将 JSON 数据展开为虚拟表行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- json_each：展开数组或对象的直接子元素&#10;SELECT&#10;    p.name,&#10;    je.value AS tag&#10;FROM products p, json_each(p.meta, &#39;$.tags&#39;) je;&#10;&#10;-- json_tree：递归展开所有层级&#10;SELECT&#10;    key, value, type, path&#10;FROM json_tree(&#39;{&quot;a&quot;:{&quot;b&quot;:[1,2],&quot;c&quot;:&quot;x&quot;}}&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_each：展开数组或对象的直接子元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    je</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products p, json_each(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.tags'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) je;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_tree：递归展开所有层级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_tree(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"a\":{\"b\":[1,2],\"c\":\"x\"}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    JSON[JSON 数据] --&gt; EACH[json_each&lt;br/&gt;展开一层]&#10;    JSON --&gt; TREE[json_tree&lt;br/&gt;递归展开]&#10;    EACH --&gt; ROWS1[扁平行集]&#10;    TREE --&gt; ROWS2[包含 path 的完整行集]\">graph TD\n    JSON[JSON 数据] --&gt; EACH[json_each&lt;br/&gt;展开一层]\n    JSON --&gt; TREE[json_tree&lt;br/&gt;递归展开]\n    EACH --&gt; ROWS1[扁平行集]\n    TREE --&gt; ROWS2[包含 path 的完整行集]</pre><p>json_each 返回的列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>列名</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>key</td>\n<td>对象键名或数组索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>value</td>\n<td>元素值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>type</td>\n<td>值类型（object/array/text/integer/real/null）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>atom</td>\n<td>标量值（非容器类型时等于 value）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>id</td>\n<td>内部标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>parent</td>\n<td>父元素 id</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fullkey</td>\n<td>完整 JSON Path</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>path</td>\n<td>父级 JSON Path</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查找包含特定 tag 的产品&#10;SELECT DISTINCT p.name&#10;FROM products p, json_each(p.meta, &#39;$.tags&#39;) je&#10;WHERE je.value = &#39;pro&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 统计每个品牌的产品数量和平均 RAM&#10;SELECT&#10;    meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; AS brand,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS count,&#10;    AVG(CAST(meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.specs.ram&#39; AS INTEGER)) AS avg_ram&#10;FROM products&#10;GROUP BY 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查找包含特定 tag 的产品</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products p, json_each(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.tags'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) je</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> je</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pro'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 统计每个品牌的产品数量和平均 RAM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.specs.ram'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_ram</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"聚合为-json\">聚合为 JSON</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- json_group_array：将多行聚合为 JSON 数组&#10;SELECT json_group_array(name) AS all_products FROM products;&#10;-- [&quot;笔记本电脑&quot;,&quot;智能手机&quot;,&quot;平板电脑&quot;]&#10;&#10;-- json_group_object：将多行聚合为 JSON 对象&#10;SELECT json_group_object(name, meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39;) AS product_brands&#10;FROM products;&#10;-- {&quot;笔记本电脑&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;,&quot;智能手机&quot;:&quot;Samsung&quot;,&quot;平板电脑&quot;:&quot;Apple&quot;}&#10;&#10;-- 构建嵌套 JSON 结构&#10;SELECT json_group_object(&#10;    brand,&#10;    json(product_list)&#10;) AS by_brand&#10;FROM (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; AS brand,&#10;        json_group_array(name) AS product_list&#10;    FROM products&#10;    GROUP BY 1&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_group_array：将多行聚合为 JSON 数组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_group_array(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> all_products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- [\"笔记本电脑\",\"智能手机\",\"平板电脑\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- json_group_object：将多行聚合为 JSON 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_group_object(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_brands</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"笔记本电脑\":\"Apple\",\"智能手机\":\"Samsung\",\"平板电脑\":\"Apple\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 构建嵌套 JSON 结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json_group_object(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    brand,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product_list)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> by_brand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brand,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        json_group_array(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"json-索引\">JSON 索引</h2><p>在 JSON 字段上创建索引可以显著加速查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 在 JSON 路径上创建索引&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_products_brand ON products(json_extract(meta, &#39;$.brand&#39;));&#10;&#10;-- 使用 -&gt;&gt; 操作符创建索引（3.38+）&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_products_ram ON products(meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.specs.ram&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 查询将自动使用索引&#10;SELECT name FROM products WHERE meta -&gt;&gt; &#39;$.brand&#39; = &#39;Apple&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 在 JSON 路径上创建索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_products_brand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products(json_extract(meta, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 使用 ->> 操作符创建索引（3.38+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_products_ram</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products(meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.specs.ram'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查询将自动使用索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">->></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '$.brand'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Apple'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> JSON 路径索引是 <strong>表达式索引</strong>（Expression Index）的一种。确保 WHERE 子句中的表达式与索引定义完全一致，否则索引不会被使用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((JSON 支持))&#10;    提取与查询&#10;      json_extract&#10;      -&gt; / -&gt;&gt; 操作符&#10;      JSON Path 语法&#10;    修改&#10;      json_set&#10;      json_replace&#10;      json_insert&#10;      json_remove&#10;    表值函数&#10;      json_each 展开一层&#10;      json_tree 递归展开&#10;    聚合&#10;      json_group_array&#10;      json_group_object&#10;    性能&#10;      表达式索引&#10;      JSONB 二进制格式\">mindmap\n  root((JSON 支持))\n    提取与查询\n      json_extract\n      -&gt; / -&gt;&gt; 操作符\n      JSON Path 语法\n    修改\n      json_set\n      json_replace\n      json_insert\n      json_remove\n    表值函数\n      json_each 展开一层\n      json_tree 递归展开\n    聚合\n      json_group_array\n      json_group_object\n    性能\n      表达式索引\n      JSONB 二进制格式</pre><ul>\n<li>SQLite 的 <strong>JSON 函数</strong>（3.9+）支持在 SQL 中直接操作 JSON 数据。</li>\n<li><strong><code>-&gt;&gt;</code></strong> 操作符（3.38+）返回 SQL 原生类型，适合在 WHERE 和索引中使用。</li>\n<li><strong>json_each</strong> 和 <strong>json_tree</strong> 将 JSON 展开为虚拟表行，实现关系化查询。</li>\n<li>通过<strong>表达式索引</strong>可以加速 JSON 路径查询。</li>\n<li><strong>JSONB</strong>（3.45+）以二进制格式存储 JSON，解析性能更高。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"JSON 支持","id":"json-支持"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON 函数概述","id":"json-函数概述"},{"level":2,"text":"提取与查询","id":"提取与查询"},{"level":2,"text":"修改 JSON","id":"修改-json"},{"level":2,"text":"表值函数","id":"表值函数"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合为 JSON","id":"聚合为-json"},{"level":2,"text":"JSON 索引","id":"json-索引"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CTE 与递归查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/cte-and-recursive"},"next":{"title":"全文搜索 FTS5","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/sqlite-embedded-db/advanced-sql/full-text-search"}}